msgstr "点击分配颜色"

#: contents/ui/tabs/AboutTab.qml
msgid "Version %1"
msgstr "版本 %1"

#: contents/ui/tabs/AboutTab.qml
msgid ""
"Per-application and per-window color overlays for the Plasma task manager."
msgstr "为 Plasma 任务管理器提供按应用和按窗口的颜色叠加。"

#: contents/ui/tabs/AboutTab.qml
msgid "Enjoying this plasmoid? Support its development!"
msgstr "喜欢这个小部件？支持它的开发！"

#: contents/ui/tabs/AboutTab.qml
msgid ""
"This plasmoid is developed and maintained on my free time. If you find it "
"useful, a small donation helps keep it going!"
msgstr ""
"这个小部件是在我的空闲时间开发和维护的。如果您觉得它有用，小额捐赠将帮助它持"
"续发展！"

#: contents/ui/tabs/AboutTab.qml
msgid "Buy me a coffee"
msgstr "Buy me a coffee"

#: contents/ui/tabs/ApplicationsTab.qml
msgid ""
"Assign a persistent color to each application. The color applies to all "
"windows of that application."
msgstr "为每个应用分配持久颜色。颜色适用于该应用的所有窗口。"

#: contents/ui/tabs/ApplicationsTab.qml
msgid "No tasks detected — open some windows to assign colors."
msgstr "未检测到任务——请打开窗口以分配颜色。"

#: contents/ui/tabs/ApplicationsTab.qml
msgid "(pinned)"
msgstr "（固定）"

#: contents/ui/tabs/ApplicationsTab.qml
msgid "Auto color disabled for this app — click to re-enable"
msgstr "此应用的自动颜色已禁用 — 点击重新启用"

#: contents/ui/tabs/ApplicationsTab.qml
msgid "Color auto-extracted from icon — click to disable"
msgstr "颜色已从图标自动提取 — 点击禁用"

#: contents/ui/tabs/ApplicationsTab.qml
msgid "Extracting color from icon…"
msgstr "正在从图标提取颜色…"

#: contents/ui/tabs/ApplicationsTab.qml
msgid "Auto color overridden by manual color"
msgstr "自动颜色已被手动颜色覆盖"

#: contents/ui/tabs/ApplicationsTab.qml
msgid "auto"
msgstr "自动"

#: contents/ui/tabs/ApplicationsTab.qml contents/ui/tabs/WindowsTab.qml
msgid "nyan"
msgstr "nyan"

#: contents/ui/tabs/ApplicationsTab.qml
msgid "Color for: %1"
msgstr "颜色：%1"

#: contents/ui/tabs/ApplicationsTab.qml
msgid "Remove color"
msgstr "移除颜色"

#: contents/ui/tabs/ApplicationsTab.qml contents/ui/tabs/WindowsTab.qml
msgid "Click again to confirm"
msgstr "再次点击确认"

#: contents/ui/tabs/ApplicationsTab.qml
msgid "Reset all colors"
msgstr "重置所有颜色"

#: contents/ui/tabs/NyanTab.qml
msgid ""
"Configure the rainbow animation effect. Enable it per-app using the switch "
"next to each color button in the Applications tab."
msgstr ""
"配置彩虹动画效果。在应用程序选项卡中，使用每个颜色按钮旁边的开关为每个应用启"
"用。"

#: contents/ui/tabs/NyanTab.qml
msgid "Speed"
msgstr "速度"

#: contents/ui/tabs/NyanTab.qml
msgid "Duration of one full rainbow cycle. Lower = faster."
msgstr "一个完整彩虹周期的持续时间。越低 = 越快。"

#: contents/ui/tabs/NyanTab.qml
msgid "Style"
msgstr "样式"

#: contents/ui/tabs/NyanTab.qml
msgid "Flat"
msgstr "平面"

#: contents/ui/tabs/NyanTab.qml
msgid "Wave"
msgstr "波浪"

#: contents/ui/tabs/NyanTab.qml
msgid "Original"
msgstr "经典"

#: contents/ui/tabs/NyanTab.qml
msgid "Color-shifting flat bands."
msgstr "颜色渐变的平面色带。"

#: contents/ui/tabs/NyanTab.qml
msgid ""
"Faithful to the original Nyan Cat rainbow: constant-width bands with "
"alternating vertical offset."
msgstr "忠于 Nyan Cat 原版彩虹：等宽色带，交替垂直偏移。"

#: contents/ui/tabs/NyanTab.qml
msgid "Wavy band edges with flowing animation."
msgstr "波浪形色带边缘，流动动画。"

#: contents/ui/tabs/NyanTab.qml
msgid "Animation FPS"
msgstr "动画帧率"

#: contents/ui/tabs/NyanTab.qml
msgid ""
"Refresh interval in ms. Lower = smoother but more CPU. Default: 150ms (~7 "
"fps)."
msgstr "刷新间隔（毫秒）。越低越流畅，但CPU占用越高。默认：150ms（约7帧/秒）。"

#: contents/ui/tabs/NyanTab.qml
msgid "Preview"
msgstr "预览"

#: contents/ui/tabs/SettingsTab.qml
msgid "Configure how colors are displayed on task manager entries."
msgstr "配置任务管理器条目上的颜色显示方式。"

#: contents/ui/tabs/SettingsTab.qml
msgid "Appearance"
msgstr "外观"

#: contents/ui/tabs/SettingsTab.qml
msgid "Mode"
msgstr "模式"

#: contents/ui/tabs/SettingsTab.qml
msgid "How the color overlay is rendered on each task."
msgstr "颜色叠加在每个任务上的渲染方式。"

#: contents/ui/tabs/SettingsTab.qml
msgid "Thickness"
msgstr "厚度"

#: contents/ui/tabs/SettingsTab.qml
msgid "Auto"
msgstr "自动"

#: contents/ui/tabs/SettingsTab.qml
msgid "Border/line thickness. Auto reads from theme SVG margins."
msgstr "边框/线条厚度。自动从主题 SVG 边距读取。"

#: contents/ui/tabs/SettingsTab.qml
msgid "Opacity"
msgstr "不透明度"

#: contents/ui/tabs/SettingsTab.qml
msgid "Color overlay intensity."
msgstr "背景填充强度。"

#: contents/ui/tabs/SettingsTab.qml
msgid "Corners"
msgstr "圆角"

#: contents/ui/tabs/SettingsTab.qml
msgid "Corner rounding. Auto matches current theme. Max = perfect circle."
msgstr "圆角弧度。自动匹配当前主题。最大 = 完美圆形。"

#: contents/ui/tabs/SettingsTab.qml
msgid "Soften colors"
msgstr "柔化颜色"

#: contents/ui/tabs/SettingsTab.qml
msgid ""
"Adapts colors to match the current theme brightness. Makes vivid colors less "
"harsh."
msgstr "使颜色适应当前主题的亮度。让鲜艳的颜色不那么刺眼。"

#: contents/ui/tabs/SettingsTab.qml
msgid "Show window count indicators"
msgstr "显示窗口数量指示器"

#: contents/ui/tabs/SettingsTab.qml
msgid ""
"Show small segment dots when multiple windows are grouped under one task."
msgstr "当多个窗口分组在同一任务下时显示小圆点。"

#: contents/ui/tabs/SettingsTab.qml
msgid "Theme decoration (inactive)"
msgstr "主题装饰（非活动）"

#: contents/ui/tabs/SettingsTab.qml
msgid ""
"Select which Plasma theme borders to show on inactive task buttons. Uncheck "
"all to hide decoration."
msgstr "选择在非活动任务按钮上显示哪些 Plasma 主题边框。全部取消勾选可隐藏装饰。"

#: contents/ui/tabs/SettingsTab.qml
msgid "Top border"
msgstr "顶部边框"

#: contents/ui/tabs/SettingsTab.qml
msgid "Bottom border"
msgstr "底部边框"

#: contents/ui/tabs/SettingsTab.qml
msgid "Left border"
msgstr "左侧边框"

#: contents/ui/tabs/SettingsTab.qml
msgid "Right border"
msgstr "右侧边框"

#: contents/ui/tabs/SettingsTab.qml
msgid "Theme decoration (hover)"
msgstr "主题装饰（悬停）"

#: contents/ui/tabs/SettingsTab.qml
msgid ""
"Select which Plasma theme borders to show when hovering. Uncheck all to hide "
"decoration."
msgstr "选择悬停时显示哪些 Plasma 主题边框。全部取消勾选可隐藏装饰。"

#: contents/ui/tabs/SettingsTab.qml
msgid "Focused window"
msgstr "聚焦窗口"

#: contents/ui/tabs/SettingsTab.qml
msgid "Theme decoration (focused)"
msgstr "主题装饰（焦点）"

#: contents/ui/tabs/SettingsTab.qml
msgid ""
"Select which Plasma theme borders to show on focused tasks. Uncheck all to "
"hide decoration."
msgstr "选择在获得焦点的任务上显示哪些 Plasma 主题边框。全部取消勾选可隐藏装饰。"

#: contents/ui/tabs/SettingsTab.qml
msgid "Focused window:"
msgstr "聚焦窗口："

#: contents/ui/tabs/SettingsTab.qml
msgid "Hide overlay"
msgstr "隐藏叠加层"

#: contents/ui/tabs/SettingsTab.qml
msgid "Background (80%)"
msgstr "背景（80%）"

#: contents/ui/tabs/SettingsTab.qml
msgid "Custom style…"
msgstr "自定义样式…"

#: contents/ui/tabs/SettingsTab.qml
msgid "How the color overlay behaves when a task has focus."
msgstr "当任务获得焦点时颜色叠加层的行为方式。"

#: contents/ui/tabs/SettingsTab.qml
msgid "Focused style:"
msgstr "聚焦样式："

#: contents/ui/tabs/SettingsTab.qml
msgid "Border thickness for focused windows."
msgstr "聚焦窗口的边框粗细。"

#: contents/ui/tabs/SettingsTab.qml
msgid "Custom opacity"
msgstr "自定义不透明度"

#: contents/ui/tabs/SettingsTab.qml
msgid "Custom corners"
msgstr "自定义圆角"

#: contents/ui/tabs/SettingsTab.qml
msgid "Minimized window"
msgstr "最小化窗口"

#: contents/ui/tabs/SettingsTab.qml
msgid "Minimized windows:"
msgstr "最小化窗口："

#: contents/ui/tabs/SettingsTab.qml
msgid "Normal (no change)"
msgstr "正常（无变化）"

#: contents/ui/tabs/SettingsTab.qml
msgid "Dim overlay"
msgstr "变暗叠加层"

#: contents/ui/tabs/SettingsTab.qml
msgid "Desaturate (grayscale)"
msgstr "去饱和（灰度）"

#: contents/ui/tabs/SettingsTab.qml
msgid "How color overlays behave on minimized windows."
msgstr "最小化窗口上颜色叠加层的行为方式。"

#: contents/ui/tabs/SettingsTab.qml
msgid "Desaturation style:"
msgstr "去饱和样式："

#: contents/ui/tabs/SettingsTab.qml
msgid "Grayscale"
msgstr "灰度"

#: contents/ui/tabs/SettingsTab.qml
msgid "Partial (keep hue)"
msgstr "部分（保留色相）"

#: contents/ui/tabs/SettingsTab.qml
msgid ""
"Grayscale removes all color. Partial keeps the hue but reduces saturation."
msgstr "灰度移除所有颜色。部分保留色相但降低饱和度。"

#: contents/ui/tabs/SettingsTab.qml
msgid "Minimized style:"
msgstr "最小化样式："

#: contents/ui/tabs/SettingsTab.qml
msgid "Use a different display mode when windows are minimized."
msgstr "当窗口最小化时使用不同的显示模式。"

#: contents/ui/tabs/SettingsTab.qml
msgid "Effect:"
msgstr "效果："

#: contents/ui/tabs/SettingsTab.qml
msgid "None"
msgstr "无"

#: contents/ui/tabs/SettingsTab.qml
msgid "Desaturate overlay"
msgstr "去饱和叠加层"

#: contents/ui/tabs/SettingsTab.qml
msgid "Border thickness for minimized windows."
msgstr "最小化窗口的边框粗细。"

#: contents/ui/tabs/SettingsTab.qml
msgid "Behavior"
msgstr "行为"

#: contents/ui/tabs/SettingsTab.qml
msgid "Pinned apps:"
msgstr "固定应用："

#: contents/ui/tabs/SettingsTab.qml
msgid "Always colored"
msgstr "始终着色"

#: contents/ui/tabs/SettingsTab.qml
msgid "Only when running"
msgstr "仅在运行时"

#: contents/ui/tabs/SettingsTab.qml
msgid "Show color on pinned favorites even when no window is open."
msgstr "即使没有打开窗口，也在固定收藏上显示颜色。"

#: contents/ui/tabs/SettingsTab.qml
msgid "Auto color:"
msgstr "自动颜色："

#: contents/ui/tabs/SettingsTab.qml
msgid ""
"Automatically extract and apply a dominant color from each application icon. "
"Only applies to apps without a manual color or Nyan mode."
msgstr ""
"自动从每个应用程序图标中提取并应用主色调。仅适用于没有手动颜色或 Nyan 模式的"
"应用。"

#: contents/ui/tabs/SettingsTab.qml
msgid "Extracting colors…"
msgstr "正在提取颜色…"

#: contents/ui/tabs/SettingsTab.qml
msgid "Refresh auto colors"
msgstr "刷新自动颜色"

#: contents/ui/tabs/SettingsTab.qml
msgid ""
"Re-extract icon colors for all applications. Useful after changing icon "
"themes."
msgstr "重新提取所有应用程序的图标颜色。更换图标主题后很有用。"

#: contents/ui/tabs/SettingsTab.qml
msgid "Widget"
msgstr "小部件"

#: contents/ui/tabs/SettingsTab.qml
msgid "Hide widget icon from panel"
msgstr "从面板隐藏小部件图标"

#: contents/ui/tabs/SettingsTab.qml
msgid ""
"The widget icon is hidden. Colors continue to work. To show it again: right-"
"click the panel → Enter Edit Mode → the widget will reappear → right-click "
"it → uncheck this option. Tip: a global shortcut can open this popup even "
"when hidden."
msgstr ""
"小部件图标已隐藏。颜色功能继续工作。要重新显示：右键点击面板 → 进入编辑模式 "
"→ 小部件将重新出现 → 右键点击它 → 取消勾选此选项。提示：即使隐藏时，全局快捷"
"键也可以打开此弹出窗口。"

#: contents/ui/tabs/SettingsTab.qml
msgid ""
"Hides the widget icon from the panel. Colors continue to work normally in "
"the background. Also available via right-click on the widget icon. Tip: set "
"a global shortcut to open this popup even when hidden."
msgstr ""
"从面板隐藏小部件图标。颜色功能在后台继续正常工作。也可通过右键点击小部件图标"
"使用。提示：设置全局快捷键，即使在隐藏时也可以打开此弹出窗口。"

#: contents/ui/tabs/SettingsTab.qml
msgid "Configure Keyboard Shortcut…"
msgstr "配置键盘快捷键…"

#: contents/ui/tabs/SettingsTab.qml
msgid ""
"Opens the widget configuration dialog where you can set a global shortcut to "
"toggle this popup."
msgstr "打开小部件配置对话框，您可以在其中设置全局快捷键来切换此弹出窗口。"

#: contents/ui/tabs/SettingsTab.qml
msgid "Select mode"
msgstr "选择模式"

#: contents/ui/tabs/SettingsTab.qml
msgid "Minimized style"
msgstr "最小化样式"

#: contents/ui/tabs/SettingsTab.qml
msgid "Focused style"
msgstr "聚焦样式"

#: contents/ui/tabs/WindowsTab.qml
msgid ""
"Temporarily override the color of a specific window. Overrides are lost when "
"the window is closed."
msgstr "临时覆盖特定窗口的颜色。关闭窗口时覆盖将丢失。"

#: contents/ui/tabs/WindowsTab.qml
msgid "No windows detected — open some windows to use per-window overrides."
msgstr "未检测到窗口——请打开窗口以使用单窗口覆盖。"

#: contents/ui/tabs/WindowsTab.qml
msgid "Custom window override"
msgstr "自定义窗口覆盖"

#: contents/ui/tabs/WindowsTab.qml
msgid "Custom nyan override"
msgstr "自定义 nyan 覆盖"

#: contents/ui/tabs/WindowsTab.qml
msgid "Nyan inherited from app — click to override"
msgstr "Nyan 继承自应用 — 点击覆盖"

#: contents/ui/tabs/WindowsTab.qml
msgid "Auto-extracted from icon — click to override"
msgstr "从图标自动提取 — 点击覆盖"

#: contents/ui/tabs/WindowsTab.qml
msgid "Color inherited from app — click to override"
msgstr "颜色继承自应用 — 点击覆盖"

#: contents/ui/tabs/WindowsTab.qml
msgid "Click to set color"
msgstr "点击设置颜色"

#: contents/ui/tabs/WindowsTab.qml
msgid "inherit"
msgstr "继承"

#: contents/ui/tabs/WindowsTab.qml
msgid "Window color override"
msgstr "窗口颜色覆盖"

#: contents/ui/tabs/WindowsTab.qml
msgid "Reset to app color"
msgstr "重置为应用颜色"

#: contents/ui/tabs/WindowsTab.qml
msgid "Reset window overrides"
msgstr "重置窗口覆盖"

